{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50260","headline":"魏夫人受大洞真经 · 李翔","name":"魏夫人受大洞真经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太极仙公降上清，爲传三十九章经。\n先教稽首丞（承）明诏，次遣斋心向洞冥。\n妙句只令岩下读，真文不许世间听。\n宝函钿轴披寻遍，始驾龙车谒帝庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}